#: ../../provisioning/jobs/security_scan.rst:2
msgid "Creating and Running Security Scan Jobs"
msgstr "Creating y Running Security Scan Jobs"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/security_scan.rst:4
msgid ""
"Security Scan Jobs allow users to create and schedule SCAP program "
"(Security Content Automation Program) scans for groups of managed "
"systems. These Jobs can call in existing SCAP packages and checklists, "
"which are used to scan the targeted systems on-demand or on a scheduled "
"basis. Historical data for these scans is saved in the Job Execution list"
" and in the software section of server detail pages. Detailed scan "
"reports can also be viewed for each system as needed once the scan is "
"complete. See the `SCAP documentation "
"<https://csrc.nist.gov/CSRC/media/Projects/Security-Content-Automation-"
"Protocol/documents/docs/scap-nistir-7343.pdf>`_ on the NIST website for "
"information on developing your own scanning procedures."
msgstr ""
"Security Scan Jobs permitir usuarios a crear y schedule SCAP program "
"(Security Content Automation Program) scans para groups de managed systems. "
"Estos Jobs puede call en existente SCAP packages y checklists, cual son "
"used a scan el/la targeted systems en-demand o en un scheduled basis. "
"Historical data para estos scans es saved en el/la Job Execution lista y en "
"el/la software sección de servidor detalle páginas. Detailed scan reports "
"puede also be viewed para cada system as needed once el/la scan es "
"complete. Ver el/la `SCAP documentation "
"<https://csrc.nist.gov/CSRC/media/Projects/Security-Content-Automation-Protocol/documents/docs/scap-nistir-7343.pdf>`_ "
"en el/la NIST website para información en developing your own scanning "
"procedures."

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/security_scan.rst:6
msgid ""
"Creating and editing Security Scan Jobs requires the \"Security: "
"Scanning\" Role permission set to Full. Viewing Security Scan Jobs and "
"seeing the results for scanned servers requires at least a Read-level "
"permission."
msgstr ""
"Creating y editing Security Scan Jobs requiere el/la \"Security: Scanning\" "
"Role permisos establecer a Full. Viewing Security Scan Jobs y seeing el/la "
"resultados para scanned servidores requiere al menos un Read-level "
"permisos."

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/security_scan.rst:9
msgid "Add a new Security Scan Job"
msgstr "Agregar un nuevo Security Scan Job"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/security_scan.rst:11
msgid ""
"New security scan packages are added in |morpheus| Library rather than "
"here in the Jobs section. Ensure you have uploaded the desired security "
"package in Library > Templates > Security Packages before proceeding with"
" new security Job creation."
msgstr ""
"Nuevo security scan packages son added en |morpheus| Library rather than "
"here en el/la Jobs sección. Ensure you tienen uploaded el/la desired "
"security package en Library > Plantillas > Security Packages antes de "
"proceeding con nuevo security Job creation."

